---
import Layout from '../layouts/main.astro';
import PageIntro from '../components/PageIntro.astro';
import { withBase } from '../lib/utils';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy | ZAKTec Solutions" description="How the ZAKTec Solutions website handles contact enquiries, hosting data, analytics and privacy requests.">
  <PageIntro eyebrow="Legal" title="Privacy Policy" description="A plain-English summary of the limited personal information associated with this website and project enquiries." />

  <section class="section-space">
    <div class="section-shell">
      <div class="content-page">
        <p><strong class="text-white">Last reviewed:</strong> 22 July 2026</p>
        <p>This page describes the website's current processing activities. It is general information and is not legal advice.</p>

        <h2>Information you provide</h2>
        <p>The website's enquiry form prepares an email in your own email application. If you choose to send it, the email may include your name, email address, organisation, service interest and project details.</p>

        <h2>How enquiries are used</h2>
        <p>Enquiry information is used only to understand your request, respond to you and discuss possible work. It is not sold or used to train AI models.</p>

        <h2>Website hosting and technical data</h2>
        <p>This static website is hosted using GitHub Pages. Like most hosting services, GitHub may process technical request information needed to deliver and protect the service. Refer to GitHub's own privacy information for details of its processing.</p>

        <h2>Analytics</h2>
        <p>No website analytics service is currently configured in this project. If analytics are introduced later, this policy and the cookie information will be updated before use.</p>

        <h2>Cookies and local storage</h2>
        <p>The active website does not set marketing, analytics or preference cookies. See the <a href={withBase('/cookies')}>cookie information page</a> for the current position.</p>

        <h2>Retention</h2>
        <p>Email enquiries are retained only for as long as reasonably needed to respond, manage the potential project and meet applicable record-keeping obligations.</p>
        <!-- TODO: Confirm and publish a specific business retention schedule before client operations scale. -->

        <h2>Access and deletion requests</h2>
        <p>You may ask what personal information is held about your enquiry, request a correction or ask for deletion where applicable.</p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>For a privacy question or request, email <a href="mailto:hello@zaktecsolutions.com">hello@zaktecsolutions.com</a>.</p>

        <div class="mt-10 rounded-xl border border-amber-300/25 bg-amber-300/5 p-5 text-sm text-amber-100">
          Business identity details and the exact enquiry-retention schedule should be confirmed as part of a formal legal review before this policy is treated as final.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
